<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-002-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.17118" lon="-120.854196"><name>SC26-002-A</name><cmt>SC26-002</cmt><desc>Southern reef crest Local high point with rough rock extending around the marker. Terrain A 86/100; not catch probability. Center 146 ft; nearby 139–180 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional point-specific flag from this screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-018</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.170540630458994" lon="-120.85624396900118"/><trkpt lat="35.17045052188201" lon="-120.85624633517224"/><trkpt lat="35.170444692693096" lon="-120.85591712069622"/><trkpt lat="35.17080512691468" lon="-120.85590765449822"/><trkpt lat="35.17080901319156" lon="-120.85612713177225"/><trkpt lat="35.17089912175615" lon="-120.8561247654383"/><trkpt lat="35.17090106475206" lon="-120.85623450421197"/><trkpt lat="35.17108128188972" lon="-120.85622977175433"/><trkpt lat="35.17126922079805" lon="-120.85666121038872"/><trkpt lat="35.17181038655883" lon="-120.85654335748481"/><trkpt lat="35.17250000626779" lon="-120.85607088453177"/><trkpt lat="35.172774983467214" lon="-120.85572123295104"/><trkpt lat="35.17306985301524" lon="-120.85509167948244"/><trkpt lat="35.17320743965356" lon="-120.85414270627452"/><trkpt lat="35.17303635967218" lon="-120.8532018